# =============================================================
# Fancy That! — public repo serves the web game via GitHub Pages.
# Everything ignored here stays on the local machine (and Dropbox)
# but is excluded from the public repository.
# =============================================================

# --- internal design & working documents ---
CLAUDE.md
fancy-that.md
UNDO_FEATURE.md
build-changes-*.md
DESIGN_UPDATE_*.md
DESIGN_CHANGES_*.md
FELD_LENS_REVIEW_*.md
RESPONSIVE_PLAN_*.md
*_HANDOFF*.md
implementation-plan.md
.claude/

# --- simulation / balance output (stats, not code) ---
# Every .txt in this repo has been sim output or an internal note.
# robots.txt is the one exception the site itself would need.
*.txt
!robots.txt
simulation-results-*.md
*-results-*.csv

# --- AI art masters (24 MB of source PNGs; the site only ever
#     loads the exported assets under images/) ---
AI Art/

# --- debug & scratch scripts ---
debug-*.js
test_patterns.js

# --- UI measurement / screenshot output (local only) ---
tools/screenshots/

# --- print / Tabletop Simulator production assets (web game uses
#     the combined sprite sheet images/reward_card_layout.png only) ---
*.indd
images/20mm_square.csv
images/reward_cards_ingredients.csv
images/reward_card_layout_ingredients.png
images/pixel_board_*.png
images/cake-stand.png
images/patisserie_*.png
images/patesserie_*.png
images/tile_*.png
images/card_back.png
images/reward_bg.png
images/place_cake.png

# --- OS / editor noise ---
Thumbs.db
.DS_Store
*.backup
